<title>PORTUGAL: Bank/Portugal drains funds at 6.40 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank/Portugal drains funds at 6.40 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal said it drained 37.4 billion escudos from the money market with one-day certificates at a fixed rate of 6.40 percent.</p>
<p>The central bank earlier announced it was cutting the rate at which it drains liquidity to 6.20 percent from the start of the new accounting period for commercial bank cash reserves which begins tomorrow.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom 3511-3538254</p>
</text>
